title A beat from scratch: steps on the pads, a recorded take, mutes on the bar
covers rec-arm, step-pads, step-hold, step-speed, track-mute, mute-queue, live-erase
wait 1.5
mark steps
pad 1 100
button STEP SEQ
expect STEP SEQ: the pads are pad A1's steps
pad 1 110
pad 5 60
pad 9 110
pad 13 60
expect steps: new clip Pattern 1 in Track 1, step 1 of pad 1 on
expect steps: step 13 of pad 1 on
button PLAY
wait 2
pad 5 100
button-down ERASE
pad 9 100
button-up ERASE
expect steps: step 5 of pad 1 off
expect steps: step 9 of pad 1 erased
wait 1
pad-down 1 100
qlink 1 +3
button Q-LINK
pad-up 1
button STEP SEQ
expect STEP SEQ: the pads play again
wait 2
button STOP
button STOP
expect STOP: transport stopped
expect STOP: all sounds stopped
mark take
button REC
expect rec: ready, PLAY records Track 1
button PLAY
expect time: transport: Record
pad 2 100
wait 0.5
pad 3 90
wait 0.5
pad 2 100
wait 3
button STOP
button PLAY
wait 4
button STOP
mark mutes
button PLAY
button SHIFT + MAIN
expect Perform: mutes land on the bar
button MAIN
button TRACK MUTE
expect TRACK MUTE · bank A: pads 1-8 mute tracks 1-8
pad 1 100
expect track mute: Track 1 muted on the next bar
wait 4
expect time: track mute: at
pad 1 100
expect track mute: Track 1 plays on the next bar
wait 4
button TRACK MUTE
expect TRACK MUTE: the pads play again
button SHIFT + MAIN
expect Make: mutes and deletes act at once
button STOP
button STOP
